# The Rust build directory is 5.9 GB and the Vercel CLI was trying to upload
# it, which made `vercel --prod` hang for fifteen minutes with no output before
# being killed. .gitignore alone did not spare it.
#
# None of the client is needed to build the site. The backend is a Hono app and
# the released exe is published through GitHub, not through here.
client/

# Local database used by `npm run dev` and the smoke suite.
backend/local.db
backend/local.db-*

node_modules/
.git/
